The Deep32 PDF converter

This folder is the PDF converter part of Deep32: chain.py, worker.py, convert.py,
the Dockerfile, and the code and configuration under production-converter/
(adapter.py, pipeline_v21.py, CHAIN.json and the conversion and fetch scripts under
production-converter/chain/), and the isolated document-styles/ command. It is free software: you can redistribute it and/or
