The full licence text is in AGPL-3.0.txt beside this file. This folder is the
complete corresponding source of the converter.

The converter is under AGPL-3.0-or-later because it uses PyMuPDF and MuPDF,
which are AGPL. The rest of the Deep32 project code is under the Apache License
2.0 (see the repository LICENSE and NOTICE), except the Library renderer
e26-render, which links MuPDF and so is also under AGPL-3.0-or-later. No other
Deep32 code includes, imports or links any file in this folder. The builder
keeps its own copy of the helper code in document-styles/vendor_common.py, at
../builder/kb-tools/vendor_common.py, and that copy is under the Apache License
2.0. The Deep32 builder starts these programs as separate processes and reads
only the files they write.

